<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">The slide presentation should be read together and with the Company&#8217;s
filings with the Securities and Exchange Commission, including the Quarterly Report on Form 10-Q for the fiscal quarter ended June 30,
2026.</p>

